WEBVTT

00:01:31.704 --> 00:01:34.737
You boys really screwed up this time.

00:01:38.438 --> 00:01:39.770
Where is he?

00:01:41.637 --> 00:01:43.770
You're never gonna
see your father again.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:49.371
They've got dad.

00:01:49.404 --> 00:01:50.737
Meg?

00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:53.137
What did she say?

00:01:53.171 --> 00:01:54.870
I just told you, sammy.

00:01:56.237 --> 00:02:00.670
Okay.

00:02:05.637 --> 00:02:07.770
What are you doing, dean?

00:02:07.804 --> 00:02:09.971
We got to go.

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:11.971
Why?

00:02:12.004 --> 00:02:14.137
Because the demon knows
we're in salvation.

00:02:14.171 --> 00:02:15.770
It knows we've got the colt.

00:02:15.804 --> 00:02:17.438
It's probably coming for us next.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.603
We've still got three bullets left.

00:02:19.637 --> 00:02:21.404
Listen, tough guy, we're not ready.

00:02:21.438 --> 00:02:23.603
We don't know how many
of them are out there.

00:02:23.637 --> 00:02:25.770
We're no good to anybody dead.

00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:28.371
We're leaving...now.

00:02:35.603 --> 00:02:39.503
I'm telling you, dean,
we could've taken him.

00:02:39.537 --> 00:02:40.971
What we need is a plan.

00:02:41.004 --> 00:02:43.503
They're keeping dad alive.
We've got to figure out where.

00:02:43.537 --> 00:02:46.171
They're gonna want to
trade him for the gun.

00:02:46.204 --> 00:02:48.470
What?

00:02:48.503 --> 00:02:51.271
If that were true, why
didn't meg mention a trade?

00:02:53.338 --> 00:02:56.371
Dad, he might be -

00:02:56.404 --> 00:02:58.537
I don't want to believe
it any more than you,

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:02.338
But if he is, all the more
reason to kill this damn thing.

00:03:02.371 --> 00:03:04.804
We still have the colt. We
can still finish the job.

00:03:04.837 --> 00:03:06.004
Screw the job, sam!

00:03:06.037 --> 00:03:08.171
Dean, i'm just trying
to do what he would want.

00:03:08.204 --> 00:03:12.004
Would you quit talking about
him like he's dead already?

00:03:12.037 --> 00:03:13.171
Listen to me.

00:03:13.204 --> 00:03:15.670
Everything stops until we get him back.

00:03:15.704 --> 00:03:17.004
Everything.

00:03:20.904 --> 00:03:22.204
So, how do we find him?

00:03:22.237 --> 00:03:23.537
Maybe we go to lincoln.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.804
Start at the warehouse
where he was taken.

00:03:25.837 --> 00:03:28.237
You really think these demons
are gonna leave a trail?

00:03:28.271 --> 00:03:30.438
You're right.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.971
We need help.

00:03:59.737 --> 00:04:01.737
Here you go.

00:04:03.804 --> 00:04:05.438
What is this
- Holy water?

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.804
That one is. This is whiskey.

00:04:13.804 --> 00:04:17.071
Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.

00:04:17.104 --> 00:04:19.570
To tell you the truth, i
wasn't sure if we should come.

00:04:19.603 --> 00:04:21.404
Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.

00:04:21.438 --> 00:04:22.603
The last time we saw you,

00:04:22.637 --> 00:04:24.804
You did threaten to blast
him full of buckshot.

00:04:24.837 --> 00:04:26.637
You cocked the shotgun and everything.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.470
Yeah, well, what can i say?

00:04:29.503 --> 00:04:31.537
John just has that effect on people.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:34.104
Yeah, i guess he does.

00:04:34.137 --> 00:04:35.438
None of that matters now.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:38.104
All that matters is
that you get him back.

00:04:38.137 --> 00:04:40.271
Bobby, this book.

00:04:40.304 --> 00:04:42.603
I've never seen anything like it.

00:04:42.637 --> 00:04:47.271
Key of solomon? It's
the real deal, all right.

00:04:47.304 --> 00:04:50.470
And these protective circles
- They really work?

00:04:50.503 --> 00:04:51.537
Hell yeah.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:55.104
You get a demon in one, they're trapped.

00:04:55.137 --> 00:04:59.071
They're powerless. It's
like a satanic roach motel.

00:04:59.104 --> 00:05:00.570
Dean: the man knows his stuff.

00:05:00.603 --> 00:05:04.570
I'll tell you something else, too.

00:05:04.603 --> 00:05:08.071
This is some serious
crap you boys stepped in.

00:05:08.104 --> 00:05:11.570
Oh, yeah? How's that?

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:15.770
Normal year, i hear, say,
three demonic possessions,

00:05:15.804 --> 00:05:17.804
Maybe four, tops.

00:05:17.837 --> 00:05:21.237
This year, i heard of 27 so far.

00:05:21.271 --> 00:05:22.804
You get what i'm saying?

00:05:22.837 --> 00:05:27.637
More and more demons are walking among us
- A lot more.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.537
Do you know why?

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.870
No, but i know it's something big.

00:05:32.904 --> 00:05:38.037
The storm's coming, and
you boys, your daddy -

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:40.470
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:47.304
Rumsfeld.

00:05:47.338 --> 00:05:48.670
What is it?

00:05:53.404 --> 00:05:55.404
Something's wrong.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:03.004
No more crap, okay?

00:06:11.837 --> 00:06:16.804
I want the colt,
sam - The real colt -

00:06:16.837 --> 00:06:20.304
Right now.

00:06:20.338 --> 00:06:22.704
We don't have it on us. We buried it.

00:06:22.737 --> 00:06:24.237
Didn't i say "no more crap"?

00:06:24.271 --> 00:06:27.371
I swear
- After everything i heard about you winchesters,

00:06:27.404 --> 00:06:30.804
I've got to tell you,
i'm a little underwhelmed.

00:06:30.837 --> 00:06:34.004
First johnny tries to
pawn off a fake gun,

00:06:34.037 --> 00:06:37.870
And then he leaves the real
gun with you two chuckleheads.

00:06:37.904 --> 00:06:39.404
Lackluster, men.

00:06:39.438 --> 00:06:45.603
I mean, did you really
think i wouldn't find you?

00:06:49.104 --> 00:06:52.937
Actually, we were counting on it.

00:07:06.404 --> 00:07:08.503
Gotcha.

00:07:22.438 --> 00:07:27.237
You know, if you wanted to tie me up,

00:07:27.271 --> 00:07:29.438
All you had to do was ask.

00:07:32.603 --> 00:07:34.737
I salted the doors and windows.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.770
If there are any demons out
there, they ain't getting in.

00:07:45.371 --> 00:07:47.171
Where's our father, meg?

00:07:47.204 --> 00:07:49.937
You didn't ask very nice.

00:07:49.971 --> 00:07:51.503
Where's our father, bitch?

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:55.670
Jeez. You kiss your
mother with that mouth?

00:07:55.704 --> 00:07:58.438
Oh, i forgot. You don't.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.737
You think this is a freaking game?!

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.637
Where is he?! What did you do to him?!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:07.137
He died screaming. I killed him myself.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:21.670
That's kind of a turn-On
- You hitting a girl.

00:08:21.704 --> 00:08:23.304
You're no girl.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.904
Dean.

00:08:28.503 --> 00:08:30.470
You okay?

00:08:30.503 --> 00:08:31.870
She's lying. He's not dead.

00:08:31.904 --> 00:08:34.438
Dean, you've got to be careful
with her. Don't hurt her.

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.171
Why?

00:08:36.204 --> 00:08:38.037
Because she really
is a girl. That's why.

00:08:38.071 --> 00:08:39.438
What are you talking about?

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:40.603
She's possessed.

00:08:40.637 --> 00:08:42.603
That's a human possessed by a demon.

00:08:42.637 --> 00:08:44.603
Can't you tell?

00:08:44.637 --> 00:08:47.438
Are you trying to tell me
there's an innocent girl

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:50.171
Trapped somewhere in there?

00:08:56.704 --> 00:08:59.037
That's actually good news.

00:09:11.171 --> 00:09:13.304
Are you gonna read me a story?

00:09:13.338 --> 00:09:17.037
Something like that. Hit it, sam.

00:09:17.071 --> 00:09:23.237
<i>"Regna terrae, cantTe
deo, psLlite dMino..."</i>

00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:27.404
An exorcism? Are you serious?

00:09:27.438 --> 00:09:29.271
We're going for it, baby
- Head spinning,

00:09:29.304 --> 00:09:31.904
Projectile vomiting,
the whole nine yards.

00:09:31.937 --> 00:09:34.470
<i>"Tribuite virtutem deo."</i>

00:09:41.104 --> 00:09:44.737
I'm gonna kill you.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:48.071
I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.

00:09:48.104 --> 00:09:50.237
No, you're gonna burn in hell

00:09:50.271 --> 00:09:52.237
Unless you tell us where our dad is.

00:09:54.537 --> 00:09:58.271
Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.937
<i>"Exorcizamus te, omnis
immundus spiritus,</i>

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:08.204
<i>"Omnis satanica potestas,</i>

00:10:08.237 --> 00:10:11.071
<i>"Omnis incursio infernalis
adversarii, omnis legio,</i>

00:10:11.104 --> 00:10:14.071
<i>"Omnis congregatio et secta diabolica."</i>

00:10:14.104 --> 00:10:15.404
Aah!

00:10:16.404 --> 00:10:21.537
He begged for his life
with tears in his eyes.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:25.404
He begged to see his sons one last time.

00:10:25.438 --> 00:10:27.204
That's when i slit his throat.

00:10:32.937 --> 00:10:33.904
<i>"Ergo..."</i>

00:10:33.937 --> 00:10:38.071
For your sake, i hope you're lying.

00:10:38.104 --> 00:10:40.304
'Cause if it's true, i swear to god,

00:10:40.338 --> 00:10:42.271
I will march into hell myself,

00:10:42.304 --> 00:10:44.704
And i will slaughter each and every one

00:10:44.737 --> 00:10:47.404
Of you evil sons of
bitches, so help me god.

00:10:47.438 --> 00:10:50.104
<i>"Perditionis venenum propinare.</i>

00:10:50.137 --> 00:10:56.937
<i>"Vade, satana, inventor et
magister omnis fallaciae,</i>

00:10:56.971 --> 00:10:59.770
<i>"Hostis humanae salutis.</i>

00:10:59.804 --> 00:11:03.271
<i>"Humiliare sub potenti manu
dei, contremisce et effuge,</i>

00:11:03.304 --> 00:11:07.004
<i>"Invocato a nobis sancto
et terribili nomine,</i>

00:11:07.037 --> 00:11:09.104
<i>Quem inferi tremunt."</i>

00:11:09.137 --> 00:11:10.603
Aah!

00:11:10.637 --> 00:11:11.971
Where is he?

00:11:13.837 --> 00:11:16.137
You just won't take "dead"
for an answer, will you?

00:11:16.171 --> 00:11:17.971
Where is he?!

00:11:18.004 --> 00:11:19.637
Dead! No, he's not!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.570
He's not dead! He can't be!

00:11:25.037 --> 00:11:27.004
What are you looking at? Keep reading.

00:11:27.037 --> 00:11:30.171
<i>"Ab insidiis diaboli,
libera nos, domine.</i>

00:11:30.204 --> 00:11:35.704
<i>"Ut ecclesiam tuam secura
tibi facias libertate servire,</i>

00:11:35.737 --> 00:11:38.338
<i>Te rogamus, audi nos."</i>

00:11:38.371 --> 00:11:41.171
Aaaah!

00:11:41.204 --> 00:11:45.503
<i>"Ut inimicos sanctae
ecclesiae humiliare digneris,</i>

00:11:45.537 --> 00:11:47.304
<i>Te rogamus audi
-"</i>

00:11:47.338 --> 00:11:48.470
He will be!

00:11:48.503 --> 00:11:49.470
Wait! What?!

00:11:49.503 --> 00:11:51.037
He's not dead,

00:11:51.071 --> 00:11:54.304
But he will be after what we do to him.

00:11:55.904 --> 00:11:58.470
How do we know you're telling the truth?

00:11:58.503 --> 00:11:59.704
You don't.

00:11:59.737 --> 00:12:01.204
Sam! A building!

00:12:01.237 --> 00:12:03.971
Okay? A building in jefferson city.

00:12:04.004 --> 00:12:06.737
Missouri? Where, where? An address.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:07.870
I don't know.

00:12:07.904 --> 00:12:09.503
And the demon
- Where is it?

00:12:09.537 --> 00:12:11.204
I don't know. I swear.

00:12:12.904 --> 00:12:15.904
That's everything. That's all i know.

00:12:20.304 --> 00:12:21.570
Finish it.

00:12:21.603 --> 00:12:23.404
What? I told you the truth.

00:12:23.438 --> 00:12:24.904
I don't care.

00:12:24.937 --> 00:12:26.404
You son of a bitch. You promised.

00:12:26.438 --> 00:12:28.737
I lied!

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.603
Sam?

00:12:32.737 --> 00:12:34.570
Sam!

00:12:36.371 --> 00:12:38.171
Read.

00:12:38.204 --> 00:12:41.004
We can still use her, find
out where the demon is.

00:12:41.037 --> 00:12:42.338
She doesn't know.

00:12:42.371 --> 00:12:45.037
There's an innocent girl
trapped somewhere in there.

00:12:45.071 --> 00:12:46.637
We've got to help her.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.271
You're gonna kill her.

00:12:48.304 --> 00:12:49.438
What?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:53.037
You said she fell from a building.

00:12:54.737 --> 00:12:57.237
That girl's body is broken.

00:12:57.271 --> 00:13:00.870
The only thing keeping her
alive is that demon inside.

00:13:00.904 --> 00:13:04.071
You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.

00:13:04.104 --> 00:13:06.137
We are not gonna leave her like that.

00:13:06.171 --> 00:13:07.304
She is a human being.

00:13:07.338 --> 00:13:10.204
And we're gonna put
her out of her misery.

00:13:10.237 --> 00:13:12.704
Sam, finish it.

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.304
Finish it.

00:13:31.271 --> 00:13:35.904
<i>"Dominicos sanctae ecclesiae.</i>

00:13:35.937 --> 00:13:37.570
<i>"Terogamus audi nos.</i>

00:13:37.603 --> 00:13:41.404
<i>"Terribilis deus de
sanctuario suo deus israhel</i>

00:13:41.438 --> 00:13:45.570
<i>"Ipse tribuite virtutem
et fortitudinem plebi suae.</i>

00:13:45.603 --> 00:13:48.271
<i>Benedictus deus. Gloria patri."</i>

00:14:24.004 --> 00:14:25.470
Dean: she's still alive.

00:14:25.503 --> 00:14:28.603
Call 911. Get some water and blankets.

00:14:31.704 --> 00:14:34.503
Thank you.

00:14:34.537 --> 00:14:37.171
Shh, shh, just take it easy, all right?

00:14:37.204 --> 00:14:38.371
Thank you.

00:14:38.404 --> 00:14:39.470
Shh.

00:14:39.503 --> 00:14:41.204
Come on. Let's get her down.

00:14:43.404 --> 00:14:46.870
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:46.904 --> 00:14:49.570
I've got you. I've got you.

00:14:49.603 --> 00:14:51.503
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:51.537 --> 00:14:55.338
A year.

00:14:55.371 --> 00:14:56.870
What?

00:14:56.904 --> 00:14:58.870
It's been a year.

00:14:58.904 --> 00:15:01.171
Just take it easy.

00:15:01.204 --> 00:15:05.004
I've been awake for some of it.

00:15:08.637 --> 00:15:11.304
I couldn't move my own body.

00:15:12.904 --> 00:15:18.037
The things i did
- It's a nightmare.

00:15:18.071 --> 00:15:20.704
Was it telling us the
truth about our dad?

00:15:20.737 --> 00:15:22.537
Dean.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:23.770
We need to know.

00:15:23.804 --> 00:15:25.371
Yes.

00:15:27.104 --> 00:15:33.271
But it wants... you to know

00:15:33.304 --> 00:15:37.204
That...they want you to come for him.

00:15:37.237 --> 00:15:40.171
If dad's still alive,
none of that matters.

00:15:51.637 --> 00:15:53.637
Where is the demon we're looking for?

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.470
Not there.

00:15:55.503 --> 00:15:59.637
Other ones.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.204
Awful ones.

00:16:02.338 --> 00:16:04.304
Where are they keeping our dad?

00:16:04.338 --> 00:16:08.904
By the r-River.

00:16:12.603 --> 00:16:14.937
Sunrise.

00:16:14.971 --> 00:16:17.271
"Sunrise"? What does that mean?

00:16:19.371 --> 00:16:21.704
What does that mean?

00:16:55.757 --> 00:16:56.357
You better hurry up and beat it

00:16:57.124 --> 00:16:58.791
Before the paramedics get here.

00:16:58.824 --> 00:17:00.323
What are you gonna tell them?

00:17:00.357 --> 00:17:03.323
You think you guys
invented lying to the cops?

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:05.957
I'll figure something out.

00:17:05.991 --> 00:17:09.290
Here. Take this. You might need it.

00:17:09.323 --> 00:17:11.091
Thanks.

00:17:12.323 --> 00:17:15.557
Thanks...for everything.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.024
Be careful, all right?

00:17:17.058 --> 00:17:18.490
Just go find your dad.

00:17:18.524 --> 00:17:21.757
And when you do, you bring
him around, would you?

00:17:21.791 --> 00:17:24.091
I won't even try to shoot him this time.

00:17:56.957 --> 00:17:58.957
You've been quiet.

00:18:00.891 --> 00:18:03.058
Just getting ready.

00:18:06.424 --> 00:18:09.424
He's gonna be fine, dean.

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.857
Dude, what are you drawing on my car?

00:18:30.891 --> 00:18:33.857
It's called a devil's trap.

00:18:33.891 --> 00:18:36.190
Demons can't get
through it or inside it.

00:18:36.223 --> 00:18:37.557
So?

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.924
It basically turns the
trunk into a lockbox.

00:18:42.924 --> 00:18:44.724
So?

00:18:44.757 --> 00:18:47.724
So we have a place to hide
the colt while we go get dad.

00:18:47.757 --> 00:18:50.557
What are you talking about?
We're bringing the colt with us.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:51.891
We can't, dean.

00:18:51.924 --> 00:18:53.657
We've only got three bullets left.

00:18:53.691 --> 00:18:55.524
We can't just use them on any demon.

00:18:55.557 --> 00:18:57.190
<i>We've got to use them on the demon.</i>

00:18:57.223 --> 00:18:59.323
No, we have to save dad, sam, okay?

00:18:59.357 --> 00:19:01.757
We're gonna need all
the help we can get.

00:19:01.791 --> 00:19:04.357
You know how pissed dad would
be if we used all the bullets?

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.524
Dean, he wouldn't want
us to bring the gun.

00:19:06.557 --> 00:19:07.924
I don't care, sam!

00:19:07.957 --> 00:19:09.524
I don't care what dad wants, okay?

00:19:09.557 --> 00:19:11.357
Since when do you care what dad wants?

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:14.058
We want to kill this demon.
You used to want that, too.

00:19:14.091 --> 00:19:16.557
Hell, you're the one who
came and got me at school!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.390
You're the one who dragged me into this.

00:19:18.424 --> 00:19:20.158
I'm just trying to finish it.

00:19:25.424 --> 00:19:28.091
Well, you and dad are a lot
more alike than i thought.

00:19:28.124 --> 00:19:30.757
You both can't wait to sacrifice
yourself for this thing.

00:19:30.791 --> 00:19:33.691
But you know what? I'm
gonna be the one to bury you.

00:19:38.058 --> 00:19:39.524
You're selfish, you know that?

00:19:39.557 --> 00:19:41.857
You don't care about
anything but revenge.

00:19:41.891 --> 00:19:43.857
That's not true, dean.

00:19:43.891 --> 00:19:45.824
I want dad back,

00:19:45.857 --> 00:19:47.991
But they are expecting
us to bring this gun.

00:19:48.024 --> 00:19:50.323
They get the gun, they will kill us all.

00:19:50.357 --> 00:19:53.158
That colt is our only
leverage, and you know it, dean.

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:56.757
We cannot bring that gun. We can't.

00:19:56.791 --> 00:19:58.624
Fine.

00:19:58.657 --> 00:20:01.223
I'm serious, dean. I said "fine," sam.

00:20:31.323 --> 00:20:33.624
Hey, hey.

00:20:33.657 --> 00:20:38.490
I think i know what
meg meant by "sunrise."

00:20:48.024 --> 00:20:51.457
Son of a bitch. That's pretty smart.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:53.290
If these demons can possess people,

00:20:53.323 --> 00:20:55.457
They can possess almost anybody inside.

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.957
And make anybody attack us.

00:20:57.991 --> 00:20:59.290
And so we can't kill 'em -

00:20:59.323 --> 00:21:01.691
A building full of human shields.

00:21:01.724 --> 00:21:04.490
They probably know exactly
what we look like, too,

00:21:04.524 --> 00:21:06.457
And they could look like anybody.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.158
This sucks out loud.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:13.257
All right, so, how the
hell are we gonna get in?

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:19.024
Pull the fire alarm, get
out all the civilians.

00:21:19.058 --> 00:21:21.024
But then the city
responds in seven minutes.

00:21:21.058 --> 00:21:23.124
Seven minutes, exactly.

00:22:24.991 --> 00:22:26.457
You okay?

00:22:31.691 --> 00:22:33.323
Hey, what's happening? Is it a fire?

00:22:33.357 --> 00:22:35.158
We're figuring that out right now, sir.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:36.657
Just stay back.

00:22:36.691 --> 00:22:39.158
I got a yorkie upstairs, and
he pees when he's nervous.

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.924
Sir, you have to stay back.

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:05.158
I always wanted to be a
fireman when i grew up.

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:07.323
You never told me that.

00:23:31.257 --> 00:23:34.757
This is the fire department.
We need you to evacuate.

00:24:04.190 --> 00:24:05.590
Hurry up!

00:24:40.757 --> 00:24:42.158
Dad.

00:24:49.158 --> 00:24:51.390
He's still breathing.

00:24:51.424 --> 00:24:53.590
Dad, wake up.

00:24:53.624 --> 00:24:54.891
Dad!

00:24:58.158 --> 00:24:59.457
Wait. Wait.

00:24:59.490 --> 00:25:00.624
What?

00:25:00.657 --> 00:25:02.691
He could be possessed, for all we know.

00:25:02.724 --> 00:25:05.457
What, are you nuts?

00:25:05.490 --> 00:25:07.257
Dean, we got to be sure.

00:25:28.957 --> 00:25:31.624
Sam?

00:25:34.290 --> 00:25:37.124
Why are you splashing water on me?

00:25:38.857 --> 00:25:41.557
Dad, are you okay?

00:25:41.590 --> 00:25:45.091
They've been drugging me.

00:25:45.124 --> 00:25:46.757
Where's the colt?

00:25:46.791 --> 00:25:49.624
Don't worry, dad, it's safe.

00:25:51.223 --> 00:25:54.824
Good, boys. Good, boys.

00:26:14.323 --> 00:26:15.791
Hey, buddy, you can't go in.

00:26:29.557 --> 00:26:30.524
Go!

00:26:30.557 --> 00:26:31.524
Back, back!

00:26:31.557 --> 00:26:33.557
Go!

00:26:40.204 --> 00:26:42.737
Sam, let's go!

00:27:00.838 --> 00:27:02.671
Sam!

00:27:36.537 --> 00:27:38.170
Sam!

00:27:38.204 --> 00:27:41.437
Sam, come on. Come on.

00:27:50.370 --> 00:27:52.003
Come on.

00:27:52.037 --> 00:27:54.237
Come on, we've got to get out of here.

00:28:33.970 --> 00:28:35.437
How is he?

00:28:35.471 --> 00:28:38.103
He just needed a
little rest, that's all.

00:28:38.137 --> 00:28:41.103
How are you?

00:28:41.137 --> 00:28:45.970
[ Inhales deeply ] i'll survive.

00:28:48.103 --> 00:28:51.070
Hey, you don't think we
were followed here, do you?

00:28:51.103 --> 00:28:52.737
I don't know. I don't think so.

00:28:52.771 --> 00:28:53.804
We couldn't have found

00:28:53.838 --> 00:28:55.704
A more out-Of-The-Way
place to hole up.

00:28:55.737 --> 00:28:58.270
Yeah.

00:29:02.270 --> 00:29:03.938
Hey, uh...

00:29:06.571 --> 00:29:08.537
Dean, you, um...

00:29:11.437 --> 00:29:14.404
You saved my life back there.

00:29:14.437 --> 00:29:18.037
So i guess you're glad
i brought the gun, huh?

00:29:18.070 --> 00:29:22.204
Man, i'm trying to thank you here.

00:29:24.437 --> 00:29:26.604
You're welcome.

00:29:37.571 --> 00:29:39.037
Hey, sam?

00:29:39.070 --> 00:29:41.037
Yeah?

00:29:41.070 --> 00:29:44.204
You know that guy i shot?

00:29:44.237 --> 00:29:46.571
There was a person in there.

00:29:51.471 --> 00:29:53.938
You didn't have a choice, dean.

00:29:53.970 --> 00:29:57.270
I know. That's not what bothers me.

00:29:57.304 --> 00:30:00.804
Then what does?

00:30:04.904 --> 00:30:07.571
Killing that guy, killing meg.

00:30:09.571 --> 00:30:12.904
I didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.

00:30:15.504 --> 00:30:18.471
For you or dad, the things
i'm willing to do or kill,

00:30:18.504 --> 00:30:20.504
It's just...

00:30:22.838 --> 00:30:25.671
It scares me sometimes.

00:30:32.170 --> 00:30:35.804
It shouldn't.

00:30:35.838 --> 00:30:37.504
You did good.

00:30:37.537 --> 00:30:39.871
You're not mad?

00:30:39.904 --> 00:30:42.471
For what?

00:30:42.504 --> 00:30:44.804
Using a bullet.

00:30:46.604 --> 00:30:50.037
Mad? I'm proud of you.

00:30:51.671 --> 00:30:56.237
You know, sam and i, we
can get pretty obsessed.

00:30:56.270 --> 00:31:01.370
But you
- You watch out for this family.

00:31:01.404 --> 00:31:03.537
You always have.

00:31:09.970 --> 00:31:11.270
Thanks.

00:31:23.237 --> 00:31:26.170
It found us. It's here. The demon?

00:31:26.204 --> 00:31:28.637
Sam, lines of salt in front
of every window, ever door.

00:31:28.671 --> 00:31:29.970
Already did it.

00:31:30.003 --> 00:31:32.437
Check it, okay?

00:31:32.471 --> 00:31:34.771
Dean, you got the gun? Yeah.

00:31:34.804 --> 00:31:36.771
Give it to me. Sam
tried to shoot the demon.

00:31:36.804 --> 00:31:38.604
It vanished.

00:31:38.637 --> 00:31:42.904
I won't miss. Now, the gun. Hurry.

00:31:46.537 --> 00:31:49.070
Son, please.

00:31:55.970 --> 00:31:58.604
Give me the gun. What
are you doing, dean?

00:31:58.637 --> 00:32:00.170
You'd be furious.

00:32:00.204 --> 00:32:01.170
What?

00:32:01.204 --> 00:32:02.571
That i wasted a bullet.

00:32:02.604 --> 00:32:05.571
He wouldn't be proud of
me. He'd tear me a new one.

00:32:12.537 --> 00:32:15.304
You're not my dad.

00:32:18.604 --> 00:32:20.904
I know my dad better than anyone,

00:32:20.937 --> 00:32:22.737
And you ain't him.

00:32:22.770 --> 00:32:24.338
What the hell has gotten into you?

00:32:24.370 --> 00:32:26.503
I could ask you the same thing.

00:32:26.537 --> 00:32:29.670
Dean? What the hell is going on?

00:32:29.704 --> 00:32:31.670
Your brother's lost his mind.

00:32:31.704 --> 00:32:32.837
He's not dad.

00:32:32.871 --> 00:32:34.004
What?

00:32:34.037 --> 00:32:35.238
I think he's possessed.

00:32:35.271 --> 00:32:37.503
I think he's been possessed
since we rescued him.

00:32:37.537 --> 00:32:39.537
Don't listen to him.
Dean, how do you know?

00:32:39.570 --> 00:32:41.037
He's different.

00:32:41.071 --> 00:32:42.271
We don't have time for this.

00:32:42.304 --> 00:32:44.570
Sam, if you want to kill this demon,

00:32:44.604 --> 00:32:46.403
You've got to trust me.

00:32:51.271 --> 00:32:53.370
Sam?

00:33:00.470 --> 00:33:02.137
No.

00:33:04.071 --> 00:33:05.238
No.

00:33:14.904 --> 00:33:16.238
Fine.

00:33:17.971 --> 00:33:23.004
You're both so sure. Go ahead.

00:33:24.470 --> 00:33:27.370
Kill me.

00:33:40.004 --> 00:33:42.670
I thought so.

00:33:55.937 --> 00:34:01.737
What a pain in the
ass this thing's been.

00:34:01.770 --> 00:34:05.403
It's you, isn't it?

00:34:05.437 --> 00:34:08.804
We've been looking for
you for a long time.

00:34:08.837 --> 00:34:10.570
Well, you found me.

00:34:10.604 --> 00:34:12.004
But the holy water?

00:34:12.037 --> 00:34:15.470
You think something like that
works on something like me?

00:34:20.570 --> 00:34:22.204
I'm gonna kill you!

00:34:22.238 --> 00:34:26.204
Oh, that would be a neat trick.

00:34:26.238 --> 00:34:29.370
In fact, here.

00:34:29.403 --> 00:34:33.804
Make the gun float to
you there, psychic boy.

00:34:42.704 --> 00:34:44.370
Well, this is fun.

00:34:44.403 --> 00:34:48.537
I could've killed you a
hundred times today, but this...

00:34:50.804 --> 00:34:52.670
This is worth the wait.

00:34:55.871 --> 00:35:01.737
Your dad
- He's in here with me,

00:35:01.770 --> 00:35:04.071
Trapped inside his own meat suit.

00:35:04.104 --> 00:35:06.470
He says "hi," by the way.

00:35:06.503 --> 00:35:08.604
He's gonna tear you apart.

00:35:11.604 --> 00:35:13.338
He's gonna taste the iron in your blood.

00:35:13.370 --> 00:35:15.503
Let him go, or i swear to god -

00:35:15.537 --> 00:35:20.338
What? What are you and god gonna do?

00:35:20.370 --> 00:35:25.104
You see, as far as i'm
concerned, this is justice.

00:35:29.403 --> 00:35:34.037
You know that little exorcism of yours?

00:35:34.071 --> 00:35:36.937
That was my daughter.

00:35:36.971 --> 00:35:38.271
Who, meg?

00:35:38.304 --> 00:35:39.971
The one in the alley?

00:35:42.071 --> 00:35:44.704
That was my boy.

00:35:44.737 --> 00:35:46.204
You understand?

00:35:46.238 --> 00:35:48.171
You've got to be kidding me.

00:35:48.204 --> 00:35:51.004
What? You're the only one
that can have a family?

00:35:51.037 --> 00:35:54.537
You destroyed my children.

00:35:54.570 --> 00:35:57.304
How would you feel if
i killed your family?

00:36:02.770 --> 00:36:06.238
Oh, that's right.

00:36:06.271 --> 00:36:08.271
I forgot. I did.

00:36:10.570 --> 00:36:15.570
Still, two wrongs don't make a right.

00:36:15.604 --> 00:36:18.071
You son of a bitch.

00:36:18.104 --> 00:36:21.637
I want to know why. Why did you do it?

00:36:21.670 --> 00:36:25.238
You mean why did i kill
mommy and pretty, little jess?

00:36:25.271 --> 00:36:26.437
Yeah.

00:36:26.470 --> 00:36:29.604
You know, i never told you this,

00:36:29.637 --> 00:36:32.971
But sam was gonna ask her to marry him.

00:36:33.004 --> 00:36:36.804
Been shopping for rings and everything.

00:36:36.837 --> 00:36:40.004
You want to know why?

00:36:40.037 --> 00:36:42.171
Because they got in the way.

00:36:42.204 --> 00:36:43.737
In the way of what?

00:36:43.770 --> 00:36:45.238
My plans for you, sammy -

00:36:45.271 --> 00:36:49.670
You...and all the children like you.

00:36:49.704 --> 00:36:53.338
Listen, you mind just
getting this over with, huh?

00:36:53.370 --> 00:36:56.004
'Cause i really can't
stand the monologuing.

00:36:56.037 --> 00:36:59.503
Funny, but that's all part
of your m.O., isn't it?

00:36:59.537 --> 00:37:03.904
Mask all that nasty
pain, mask the truth.

00:37:03.937 --> 00:37:06.104
Oh, yeah? What's that?

00:37:06.137 --> 00:37:08.437
You know, you fight, and
you fight for this family,

00:37:08.470 --> 00:37:13.670
But the truth is they don't need you.

00:37:13.704 --> 00:37:15.971
Not like you need them.

00:37:18.004 --> 00:37:22.037
Sam
- He's clearly john's favorite.

00:37:22.071 --> 00:37:24.604
Even when they fight,

00:37:24.637 --> 00:37:27.904
It's more concern than
he's ever shown you.

00:37:30.037 --> 00:37:34.004
I bet you're real proud
of your kids, too, huh?

00:37:34.037 --> 00:37:38.837
Oh, wait, i forgot. I wasted 'em.

00:37:52.537 --> 00:37:53.971
Aah!

00:37:54.004 --> 00:37:56.537
Dean!

00:37:56.570 --> 00:37:58.204
No!

00:38:05.171 --> 00:38:07.704
Dad!

00:38:07.737 --> 00:38:10.770
Dad, don't you let it kill me!

00:38:12.370 --> 00:38:14.004
Dean!

00:38:27.470 --> 00:38:29.604
Dad, please.

00:38:37.470 --> 00:38:38.904
Dean!

00:38:41.104 --> 00:38:43.837
No! Stop.

00:38:45.604 --> 00:38:47.437
Stop it.

00:38:55.238 --> 00:38:59.104
You kill me, you kill daddy.

00:38:59.137 --> 00:39:00.737
I know.

00:39:11.171 --> 00:39:14.137
Dean? Dean? Hey.

00:39:14.171 --> 00:39:15.637
Oh, god, you lost a lot of blood.

00:39:15.670 --> 00:39:17.804
Where's dad?

00:39:17.837 --> 00:39:19.937
He's right here. He's right here, dean.

00:39:19.971 --> 00:39:24.437
Go check on him.

00:39:32.637 --> 00:39:36.770
Dad?

00:39:36.804 --> 00:39:39.104
Sammy!

00:39:39.137 --> 00:39:42.837
It's still alive. It's
inside me. I can feel it.

00:39:42.871 --> 00:39:44.004
You shoot me.

00:39:44.037 --> 00:39:47.503
You shoot me! You shoot
me in the heart, son!

00:39:47.537 --> 00:39:50.071
Do it, now!

00:39:50.104 --> 00:39:51.904
Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.

00:39:51.937 --> 00:39:53.338
You've got to hurry.

00:39:53.370 --> 00:39:55.271
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:39:55.304 --> 00:39:58.437
You shoot me, son! Shoot me!

00:39:58.470 --> 00:40:01.670
Son, i'm begging you! We
can end this here and now!

00:40:02.837 --> 00:40:05.470
Sammy, you kill me!

00:40:05.503 --> 00:40:06.637
Sam, no.

00:40:06.670 --> 00:40:09.370
You do this!

00:40:09.403 --> 00:40:11.937
Sammy!

00:40:11.971 --> 00:40:15.304
Sam, sam...

00:40:19.338 --> 00:40:21.271
I'm begging you, son. You've got to.

00:40:21.304 --> 00:40:24.338
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:24.370 --> 00:40:26.238
Shoot me!

00:40:52.204 --> 00:40:55.671
Look, just hold on, all right?

00:40:55.704 --> 00:40:59.037
The hospital is only 10 minutes away.

00:40:59.070 --> 00:41:02.804
I'm surprised at you, sammy.
Why didn't you kill it?

00:41:02.838 --> 00:41:05.137
I thought we saw
eye-To-Eye on this.

00:41:05.170 --> 00:41:06.704
Killing this demon comes first -

00:41:06.737 --> 00:41:09.404
Before me, before everything.

00:41:11.970 --> 00:41:15.871
No, sir, not before everything.

00:41:15.904 --> 00:41:19.070
Look, we've still got the colt.

00:41:19.103 --> 00:41:20.737
We still have the one bullet left.

00:41:20.771 --> 00:41:22.571
We just have to start over, all right?

00:41:22.604 --> 00:41:23.938
We already found the demon -



00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
